  "template": "Welcome to this unusual game that will help you to become {a_target_speaker}. Here's how it works - I teach you something {in_target}, then I say something {in_known} and give you a chance to say it out loud {in_target}. Then, you listen carefully to the {target_speakers} who will model it for you. It's important that you say something in the gaps, because that's how you learn. Even if you aren't sure, have a go at saying whatever you can, and you'll be starting to speak {in_target} sooner than you think. The more you treat it as a game, the more playful you are with it, the more you laugh when you make mistakes, the better it will go and the faster you will learn. So, let's start playing.",
